.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    Browse the organization’s aspirational values, keep them ordered and clear, and open a value to tighten what “living it” means.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"
  %p.mb-3
    Values are the cultural expectations the company holds. Clear, shared meaning — confirmed through aligned check-ins — is what makes values usable in MAAP.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 Header
  %ul.mb-3
    %li
      %strong Values · List
      switches object and page type (Health, Insights).
    %li The info icon expands this help.
    %li
      The
      %i.bi.bi-plus
      button creates a new value (requires MAAP management permission).

  %h5.fw-semibold.mb-2 How to use the list
  %ul.mb-3
    %li Filter &amp; Sort controls which values appear and in what order.
    %li
      Each row links to the value. Switch to
      %strong Health
      to see Expectation Alignment scores across values.
